>1) How do you make a weapon rustproff?  I've read about Excalibur, but I'm
>   playing a wizard with 'the rusty Magicbane' now.

	Read a non-cursed scroll of enchant weapon over the weapon while
confused.  If the scroll is cursed, it will remove the rust-proofing from a
weapon that has it.

>2) When you are a wizard and 'use up' a spell, how do you get it back?

	Go back and re-read your spellbooks.  Reading the same book twice in a
row will allow you to cast the spell twice as many times before you need to
study again.

